OL,3,GNEWSAThe younger record fans turning to
OL,4,Aolder vinyl
OL,5,
OL,6,FYounger people are helping the revival
OL,7,Fof traditional vinyl records, according
OL,8,Fto record dealers.
OL,10,FRoger Joffe, co-owner of Wanted Records
OL,11,Fand organiser of the biggest record
OL,12,Ffair in the south-west of England, held
OL,13,Fat the Bristol Beacon, said: "The
OL,14,Fyoungsters are coming in and buying
OL,15,Ftrance and dance music, but also trad
OL,16,Fjazz and Duke Ellington."
OL,18,FJoffe believes newer fans find the
OL,19,Fformat appealing and want to hold
OL,20,Fsomething physically rather than
OL,21,Fstreaming music.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
